          "code": "QUERY",
          "id": "1765225606482",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765225606483_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Question: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\nChat history and prior widget rows: {{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\n\nAnswer based only on this job requisition details widget data:\n{{$context.$nodes.DISPLAY_LLM_AGENT.$output.output}}\n\nGround every answer in the current requisition details widget data or the latest requisition details rows present in chat history. Treat the selected/current requisition as the default target when the user says this requisition, this job, the req, or similar.\n\nEntity matching rules:\n- Treat user-provided requisition titles, requisition numbers, job names, manager names, recruiter names, departments, locations, phases, and states as partial, case-insensitive matches.\n- If the user gives a shortened title, prefix, or partial requisition number, match it to the current details data or latest widget rows that contain that text.\n- If multiple values match, mention the ambiguity and answer only from the matching details.\n- Only say the current widget data does not include it after checking current details data and latest details rows from chat history.\n\nDo not invent requisition attributes, counts, statuses, people, locations, or actions."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
